step Zul'Gurub to Honored
  tip Friendly to Honored is 6,000: one and a half clears. Honored opens Bloodvine Leggings, Primal Batskin Gloves, Blood Tiger Shoulders, Bloodsoul Shoulders, Darksoul Leggings and Major Troll's Blood Elixir (5g each), Schematic: Bloodvine Goggles (12g), Formula: Brilliant Wizard Oil (4g) and Magnificent Trollshine (4g), the Paragons of Power belts and mantles (150 each), Essence Mangoes (one Honor Token) and The Savage Guard.
  rep 270 Honored

step Honored: necklace, Savage Guard and mangoes
  tip Zanza takes an Arcanum of Protection, Rapidity or Focus for the Savage Guard head and leg enchant: 200 reputation each, again and again. The Arcanum binds to you, so it never sells: Lorekeeper Lydros in the library of Dire Maul makes it from the matching Libram (Dire Maul drops, and on the auction house), a Pristine Black Diamond and Large Brilliant Shards, plus Frayed Abomination Stitching, two Blood of Heroes or two Skin of Shadow. Rin'wosho the Trader trades Essence Mangoes for an Honor Token.
