step Exalted: the Signets of the Zandalar
  tip At Exalted your necklace takes its last upgrade, Rin'wosho sells Recipe: Living Action Potion (5g), and Rin'wosho trades 15 Zandalar Honor Tokens for one Signet of the Zandalar, the shoulder enchant: Might (attack power), Mojo (spell damage) or Serenity (healing).
